      "process_md": "**Step 1:** Fishermen must obtain a token number from [https://fisheries.gujarat.gov.in/Registration.aspx using their personal details.](https://fisheries.gujarat.gov.in/Registration.aspx)\n**Step 2:** Diesel cardholder fishermen must purchase fuel from government-approved diesel pumps.\n**Step 3:** The VAT relief is credited automatically via an online system.\n"
