  "detailed_description": "The &amp;quot;Diesel VAT Relief Scheme for Fishermen&amp;quot; introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, aims to support fishermen by subsidizing the VAT on diesel, making fuel more affordable for their mechanized boats. This helps reduce the operational cost of fishermen using mechanized boats.\n",
  "eligibility": "\n  - The applicant must be a registered diesel cardholder.\n  - The applicant must own a mechanized fishing boat.\n  - The boat should be less than 20 meters in length.\n\n<br>\n\n",
  "exclusions": null,
